action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P48 on Android: the LazyVGrid / LazyHGrid layouts. Pass: grid 1 three flexible
# columns; grid 2 a narrow two-wide block; grid 3 several per row; grid 5 reads
# 1/2, 3/4, 5/6 across; grid 6 has its three lanes drawn as grey bands and each
# cell sits against the top, in the middle, and against the bottom of its band.
# Grid 6 is below the launch screen, so the file scrolls down.
# Coordinates are POINTS (px / 2.625 on this 420-dpi emulator), measured
# 2026-10-01 from a uiautomator dump of the launch screen.
# 座標是點(像素 / 2.625),2026-10-01 量自啟動畫面的 uiautomator dump。
# P48 在 Android 上:各格線版面。grid 6 在啟動畫面下方，所以向下捲;每個儲存格須分別貼灰帶頂端、置中、底端。
sleep,,,,,,2000000,let the grids lay out,android
# 2026-10-13: the park point is any point on the page that is on the screen. Matched by widget it had become
# (604, 564), past the 411-point screen, and reaching it scrolled the page sideways: grid 6 was photographed
# without its cells. From (200, 450) the capture shows grids 2, 3, 5 and all of grid 6.
# 2026-10-13:停駐點只要是頁面上、螢幕內的任何一點即可。依元件比對後它變成 (604, 564),超出 411 點寬的螢幕,
# 為了到達它頁面被橫向捲動:拍到的 grid 6 沒有儲存格。從 (200, 450) 出發,擷圖裡有 grid 2、3、5 與完整的 grid 6。
move,200,450,,,,,the middle of the page,android
scroll,0,8,,,,,down to grid 6 -- the grey lanes must be in the photograph,android
sleep,,,,,,1000000,let the scroll settle,android
